,{},"400",[322,408,409],{},"Bad Request - The request was malformed.",[307,411,412,417],{},[322,413,414],{},[325,415,416],{},"401",[322,418,419],{},"Unauthorized - Invalid or missing API key.",[307,421,422,427],{},[322,423,424],{},[325,425,426],{},"403",[322,428,429],{},"Forbidden - The API key doesn't have permission for this action.",[307,431,432,437],{},[322,433,434],{},[325,435,436],{},"404",[322,438,439],{},"Not Found - The requested resource doesn't exist.",[307,441,442,447],{},[322,443,444],{},[325,445,446],{},"409",[322,448,449],{},"Conflict - Idempotency mismatch, request still in progress, outcome unknown, a concurrent write, or a refund of the same order already being created.",[307,451,452,457],{},[322,453,454],{},[325,455,456],{},"422",[322,458,459,460,463],{},"Unprocessable Entity - Validation failed. Check the ",[325,461,462],{},"errors"," field for details.",[307,465,466,471],{},[322,467,468],{},[325,469,470],{},"429",[322,472,473],{},"Too Many Requests - Rate limit exceeded. Slow down your requests.",[307,475,476,481],{},[322,477,478],{},[325,479,480],{},"500",[322,482,483],{},"Internal Server Error - Something went wrong on Vatly's end.",[290,485],{},[293,487,489],{"id":488},"error-responses","Error responses",[286,491,492],{},"Whenever a request is unsuccessful, the Vatly API will return an error response with a human-readable message. Combine it with the HTTP status code to understand what has gone wrong and how to fix it. Most of the error messages are pretty helpful and actionable.",[494,495,501],"pre",{"className":496,"code":497,"filename":498,"language":499,"meta":500,"style":500},"language-json shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","{\n  \"message\": \"Resource not found.\"\n}\n","Error response","json","",[325,502,503,512,538],{"__ignoreMap":500},[504,505,508],"span",{"class":506,"line":507},"line",1,[504,509,511],{"class":510},"sMK4o","{\n",[504,513,515,518,522,525,528,531,535],{"class":506,"lin